			"Message": "fix(Mountain): Correct ApplicationState import and update Vine RPC invocation\n\nUpdate the import path for `ApplicationState` in `Source/ProcessManagement/InitializationData.rs` to correctly resolve the nested `State::ApplicationState::ApplicationState` struct, aligning with the refactored module hierarchy. Additionally, modify all `Vine::Client` gRPC calls in `Source/ProcessManagement/CocoonManagement.rs` to explicitly invoke the `::Fn` associated method for `ConnectToSideCar` and `SendRequest`.\n\nThis ensures proper resolution of the state type for initialization logic and adheres to the updated calling convention for the Vine gRPC client within the Rust codebase, preventing potential compilation errors and ensuring consistent RPC communication with the Cocoon sidecar.",
