			"Message": "fix(Mountain): Correct ApplicationState import path in StateBuild\n\nUpdate the import statement in `Source/Binary/Initialize/StateBuild.rs` to explicitly reference the nested `State::ApplicationState::ApplicationState` struct. The previous flat import path `ApplicationState::ApplicationState` failed to resolve the type correctly within the current module hierarchy.\n\nThis change ensures the `ApplicationState` type is properly available for state build configuration logic, aligning with the recent refactoring of the application state module structure and preventing potential compilation errors related to missing type definitions.",
